      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Legacy OpenBuilds NEMA 17 STEP reference with a 48 mm model body, from STEP Parts Library 1.5. The original export is preserved unchanged through a pinned community mirror. NEMA frame labels do not establish a universal motor body, shaft, electrical rating, or current product SKU. OpenBuilds, LLC — STEP Parts Library 1.5; unchanged source geometry mirrored by mirage335; Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0).\n\nLegacy model geometry, not a verified CAD mapping to current stock. Confirm the purchased motor's body length, mounting holes, shaft diameter and flat, shaft projection, connector and cable clearances before designing a mount. NEMA frame size alone does not establish those details or electrical compatibility. Dimensions listed here describe this STEP file; the export timestamp is not a physical hardware revision. No current SKU, torque, current, price or stock is inferred."
    }
  ],
